==Battleground==
*50 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**80 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3~4 seconds<sup>90f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] and don't think you'll be able to get to Floor 70, now is a very good time to use him. Otherwise, anti-Traitless Ubers or [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando Jr.]] should be good enough here.

